    {
      "id": "0f146531-47ef-4fd2-b326-4577d3504f60",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -192,
        96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 752,
        "height": 528,
        "content": "## AI Personal Research Assistant\n\nThis n8n workflow automates end-to-end web research, content extraction, AI analysis, and structured reporting on any research topic.\n\nTriggered via a Webhook or manual payload, the workflow:\n* Validates incoming research queries and ensures payload integrity.\n* Uses OpenAI (GPT-4o-mini) to generate focused, multi-perspective search queries.\n* Fetches real-time web articles and data sources (via search and content extraction endpoints).\n* Cleans, sanitizes, and merges gathered content into a unified research context.\n* Runs advanced AI synthesis to structure comprehensive reports covering Executive Summaries, Key Findings, Benefits, Challenges, Trends, and Source References.\n* Formats and parses extracted report sections into clean JSON key-value pairs.\n* Archives full research reports and summaries into a central Google Sheets database.\n* Dispatches real-time completion notifications to engineering or research channels in Slack.\n* Returns the structured research report directly back to the calling webhook client.\n\nIt turns unstructured web browsing into a fully automated, AI-powered research pipeline.\n"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
