              "content": "=You are a research assistant.\n\nGenerate 5 focused web search queries for the following research topic:\n\n{{ $json.topic }}\n\nThe queries should cover:\n- General overview\n- Latest developments\n- Benefits\n- Challenges\n- Future trends\n\nReturn only a JSON array of search queries."
